#=====================================================================
# gui_evwifi.NX500 — EV+WiFi merged page, nxui menu (EN)
#=====================================================================
# Merged so one key combo covers three entries instead of three combos:
# FilmLab no longer owns EV+AEL (that slot now opens the V-Log page).
# Trade-off: LUT went from "one press" to "open page + one press".
#
# Rendered by nxui's own menu renderer, not mod_gui:
#     nxui.sh menu gui_evwifi.NX500
# Menu and panel are the same binary and the same .NX500 parser, so there
# is no second UI stack to maintain.
#
# Panel switching must go through `nxui.sh switch <mode>`:
# nxui is single-instance, so exec'ing `nxui.sh lut` from here makes
# nxui.sh's pidof match the exiting panel itself -> killall -> the panel
# dies and never comes back. switch sends TERM first, waits until the old
# process is really gone, then starts the new mode.
#
# Format: button|label|command   /   @ prefix = open submenu (same renderer)
# Keep labels within 6 full-width chars. 6 entries = one nxui menu page.
#=====================================================================

button|FilmLab|nxui.sh switch filmlab
button|LUT Filter|nxui.sh switch lut
button|V-Log Curve|@/opt/usr/nx-ks/gui_vlog.NX500

button|Functions|@/opt/usr/nx-ks/gui_func.NX500
button|GO BACK|@/opt/usr/nx-ks/gui_ini.NX500
button|CANCEL|/opt/usr/nx-ks/gui_exit.sh
